// Villain Def - Arachnos_Tarantula_Mistress_Low 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P792976714" "A rare few Fortunatas volunteer for the Tarantula program. Those who survive integration with the machine are truly terrors to behold. Their specially-designed suits greatly amplify their psychic abilities, allowing them to to not only communicate the next few seconds of time to their allies, but also to distort reality for their foes as well."
// DisplayNames :
"P2806251335" "Tarantula Mistress"

