"P4050382204" "The assistant to Marshall Brass is one of the big players in Cap au Diable. Do right by her and you may be well on your way to greatness. Let Longbow defeat her and your life won't be worth much."
// DisplayNames :
"P2150478882" "Olivia Darque"

