// Villain Def - Arachnos_Olivia_Darque_Pet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Wretch_EB 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1637644672" "A twisted wreck of a human being, Wretch was horribly mutated in the same incident that slew Ghost Widow. He remains her loyal guardian and protector, using his immense strength and savage fury to protect her from all harm."
// DisplayClassName :
"P3502063231" "Elite Boss"
// DisplayNames :
"P1910652144" "Wretch"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Wretch_AV_Low 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Wretch_AV_High 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Silver_Mantis 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2633280242" "Tamura Shirai is fascinated with the smooth, sleek feel of metal. Funding the augmentation of her body to pure metal was an expensive proposition, however, so she turned to crime. During one of her robberies she encountered Black Scorpion, on a job for Lord Recluse. Tamura realized an opportunity when she saw it, and rather than fighting with Arachnos over the ill-gotten loot, formed an alliance that has lasted to this day."
// DisplayNames :
"P2060199557" "Silver Mantis"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Barracuda_EB 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3855488133" "A former treasure hunter, Kelli Forston was infected by mysterious creatures known as the Coralax. What she found in the briny deep remains a mystery, but it turned her heart as dark and cold as the depths. In combat, she is almost as quick and savage as her bloodthirsty mentor, Captain Mako."
// DisplayNames :
"P3555631364" "Barracuda"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Barracuda_AV 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Ice_Mistral 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P942917506" "Irena Rudenko was chosen by one of the Monks of the Four Winds to become the Ice Mistral. Receiving the power changed her; she retained the icy-cold aloofness and desire for mastery of the wind, but none of the control. Her own rage overrode the honor normally imbued to the Knights of the Wind and she went on a mad killing spree. Scirocco took her under his wing to protect her from the Monks - many of which have fallen trying to reclaim their lost power."
// DisplayNames :
"P743416604" "Ice Mistral"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Ghost_Widow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3507676198" "Beautiful, mysterious, and deadly. Ghost Widow appears to be an actual spirit from beyond the grave rather than a super with some sort of incorporeal power. Some have said she was once a rising star in the Night Widows when she was slain. Her thirst for vengeance must have been great, for she returned from the void and now serves at Recluse's side. There are rumors that her service isn't entirely voluntary, however."
// DisplayNames :
"P1200458581" "Ghost Widow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Spike_Trap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2703133595" "Spike Trap"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Dual_Turret 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3603313452" "Turrets like these are rumored to be based on designs stolen (or bought) from Crey industries. This one matches the design for a Dual Artillery Gun. The Crey security catalog entry reads: 'Our Dual Artillery Gun provides an excellent balance between the need for concentrated firepower and the desire to keep under budget. Ask about our options close-quarter flamethrower!'"
// DisplayNames :
"P2882659446" "Dual Artillery Gun"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Quad_Turret 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1213718413" "Turrets like these are rumored to be based on designs stolen (or bought) from Crey industries. This one matches the design for a Quad Howitzer Battery. The Crey security catalog entry reads: 'The Quad Howitzer Battery provides top-notch firepower for defending your installation with its four heavy cannons and optional flamethrower.'"
// DisplayNames :
"P535914398" "Quad Howitzer Battery"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Frag_Missile_Turret 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3531456655" "Turrets like these are rumored to be based on designs stolen (or bought) from Crey industries. This one matches the design for a High-Explosive Missile Turret. The Crey security catalog entry reads: 'When you need maximum defense and cost is no concern, the Hi-Explosive Missile Turret is the premier choice. It's high-powered explosive rockets can ruin the day for nearly any attacker.'"
// DisplayNames :
"P2288944920" "High-Explosive Missile Turret"

