// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_CoV_Agent_Lt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1425280075" "The leaders of Crey's security teams are experts at identifying threats and picking them off from a distance. With the latest in advanced assault weaponry at their disposal, these agents are a force to be reckoned with."
// DisplayNames :
"P3021396201" "Elite Security Agent"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
