// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2613383461" "The Special Agents are the best of Crey's field operatives. They have superb training, the best weapons, and a seemingly preternatural focus on the task at hand. They often carry heavy weapons, since Crey trusts them enough to use them discreetly and appropriately."
// DisplayNames :
"P321722298" "Special Agent Vigilant"

