// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Meteors_Meteor_Untargetable 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P780179882" "The meteors are numbered in Hindi after the Indian professor who first discovered Shiva. This is Meteor #1, the largest fragment, which smashed into the downtown area of Bloody Bay and created a 50-yard long trench."
// DisplayClassName :
"P4195902961" "Meteorite"
// DisplayNames :
"P2784565588" "Meteor"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Meteors_Meteor1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2763454731" "Meteor Ek"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Meteors_Meteor2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2078555822" "The meteors are numbered in Hindi after the Indian professor who first discovered Shiva. This is Meteor #2, which hit, ironically, in front of the Green Nugget Casino. Coincidence? You'll have to decide that for yourself, friend."
// DisplayNames :
"P3133148243" "Meteor Do"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Meteors_Meteor3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1023435827" "The meteors are numbered in Hindi after the Indian professor who first discovered Shiva. This is Meteor #3, which slammed into the tourist-laden Boardwalk district. The sight of guys in Hawaiian shirts running for their lives with half yard margaritas in their hands made the front pages of all the major tabloids."
// DisplayNames :
"P922217335" "Meteor Teen"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Meteors_Meteor4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2077775093" "The meteors are numbered in Hindi after the Indian professor who first discovered Shiva. This is Meteor #4, which somehow managed to maneuver through the factory above. Sadly, those closest to the strike were consumed in a green wash of radioactive death."
// DisplayNames :
"P2207026761" "Meteor Char"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Meteors_Meteor5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3119125882" "The meteors are numbered in Hindi after the Indian professor who first discovered Shiva. This is Meteor #5, which slipped through the canopy and embedded in the earthy soil of these old woods."
// DisplayNames :
"P2619717032" "Meteor Panch"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Meteors_Meteor6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1715413226" "The meteors are numbered in Hindi after the Indian professor who first discovered Shiva. This is Meteor #6. It was the last to land according to most sources."
// DisplayNames :
"P2636048083" "Meteor Jay"

