"P2688086928" "These poor chumps think they've got a chance against the Cage Consortium. Sure they're working conditions are atrocious. If most of them weren't former criminals and other troublemakers maybe they could have found better jobs in St. Martial or Grandeville instead of this dump."
// DisplayNames :
"P738672011" "Enraged Miner"

