"P230621820" "Shivan Destroyer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Shivan_Elite_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2171619880" "This Decimator seems to pulse with ectoplasmic destruction and hate.  Its grotesque form and radiant energy makes your skin crawl."
// DisplayClassName :
// DisplayNames :
"P628196174" "Shivan Decimator"

